What was taken from the original and is therefore covered by the notice above:

  * the AGSL shader sources in backdrop/internal/Shaders.kt
    (RoundedRectSDF, RoundedRectRefractionShader,
     RoundedRectRefractionWithDispersionShader,
     DefaultHighlightShader, AmbientHighlightShader);
  * the highlight / shadow / inner-shadow compositing model
    (HighlightStyle.kt, HighlightModifier.kt, ShadowModifier.kt,
     InnerShadowModifier.kt) and its default constants;
  * the vignette math of InteractiveHighlight;
  * the component specifications of the catalog
    (LiquidButton, LiquidSlider, LiquidToggle, LiquidBottomTabs,
     ControlCenter, Dialog, Magnifier, LockScreen) including their
    dp values, effect stacks, spring parameters and accent colours.

What is new in this project:

  * the entire WebGL2 rendering pipeline (FBO layer compositing, separable
    gaussian pass, SDF-based analytic shadows, canvas-to-texture backdrop);
  * the GLSL transliteration of the AGSL shaders;
  * the JavaScript component runtime, event model, spring solver and the
    public API.

